# ── Kinetic Movers — canonical URL enforcement ─────────────────────────────
# Cloudflare's static-asset serving (used by both classic Pages and Workers with
# static assets — this project runs on the latter) automatically 308-redirects
# every .html request to its extensionless equivalent (e.g. /contact.html ->
# /contact), and serves the .html file's content natively at the extensionless
# route. This is a platform-level behavior that cannot be disabled — so
# extensionless is the real canonical URL for every page on this site. Every
# rule below works WITH that behavior. Do not add any rule that redirects an
# extensionless path to a .html path — that creates an infinite redirect loop
# with Cloudflare's own default (this previously broke /locations/brampton.html,
# /about.html, /contact.html, and /thank-you.html).

# --- Folder-index normalization (safe: no .html involved) -----------------
/services /services/ 301
/SERVICES /services/ 301
/locations /locations/ 301
/content-hub /content-hub/ 301

